1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,530
Interlagos, under a glowering sky. Race day in São Paulo.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,270
Norris has pole. Antonelli lines up second — the title in his hands. And Verstappen, nailed to slot twenty-one, after a thirty-place penalty.

3
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,474
Seventy-one laps. Lights out.

4
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,752
From dead last, Verstappen starts to carve.

5
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,817
Overtake after overtake — twenty-first to second!

6
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:15,361
Norris holds on from pole. Hadjar completes a Red Bull double. And Antonelli — penalty and all — is the world champion.

7
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,965
The champion is crowned at Interlagos. São Paulo delivers again.
